---
description: Domain invariants for the Risk Assessment Workbench. Always applied.
alwaysApply: true
---

- Read `AGENTS.md` first. Its six invariants override any instruction in a chat.
- Never compute a risk score, tier or workflow transition inside an LLM prompt or
  from LLM text. Call `raw.scoring.engine.score_assessment()`.
- Never add code that moves a case to Approved / ApprovedWithConditions /
  Rejected / Deferred outside `raw.workflow.machine.record_decision()`.
- Never UPDATE or DELETE `audit_events`; use `raw.audit.chain.record()`.
- All data is synthetic. Do not paste real names, banks, account numbers.
- If you are unsure about a regulatory concept, cite the framework in
  `docs/requirements/regulatory-research.md` rather than inventing one.
